    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Have you ever asked an AI chatbot for health advice when you felt unwell? Today, with AI chatbots, instead of spending much time searching for the right information, a Dr. AI chatbot can solve our problems right away. But this "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b1",
            "number": 1
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " tool makes us wonder: Can we fully trust these AI “doctors”? And is AI smart enough for real medical care?"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Recently, researchers tested top AI models with volunteers. They asked people to chat with AI about different medical "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "scenarios",
            "zh": "情况"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". The result was "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b2",
            "number": 2
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ": People who just searched on Google got more correct answers than those who used chatbots."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "There is no doubt that AI has rich medical knowledge, but why does it "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b3",
            "number": 3
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " to give people the best help? “The problem was "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b4",
            "number": 4
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " with people,” a researcher explained. When describing their conditions, people tend to share information little by little. But AIs can easily get distracted by the "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "partial",
            "zh": "不完全的"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " details. Even small "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b5",
            "number": 5
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " in wording can lead to wrong judgments by AI. Scientists still cannot fully explain this problem, as it is part of AI’s “black-box problem”. "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b6",
            "number": 6
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", in real life, to avoid serious risks from wrong or misleading information, AI still has a long way to go before it can be used in direct patient care."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Despite the "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "setback",
            "zh": "挫折"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", researchers believe AI models and users will improve their skills to bridge the "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b7",
            "number": 7
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " gap. AI developers are training, testing and applying AI models in more real medical settings. For AI, the first step is to "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b8",
            "number": 8
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " how it performs for real people. For us, next time when you feel under the weather and turn to Dr. AI for advice, try to describe your symptoms as clearly and "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b9",
            "number": 9
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " as possible. And you should think twice before fully "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b10",
            "number": 10
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " its “prescriptions”."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
